{"id": "34a279e1-d700-454a-8806-a17ec243803d", "name": "力行最大リプル電流計算制約", "description": "モーターの回転数とトルクから力行動作領域における最大リプル電流を簡易計算します。", "inputNames": ["motor_torque", "motor_speed", "ripple_coefficient_powering"], "outputNames": ["max_ripple_powering"], "parameters": {}, "code": "# 力行側（トルクと回転数が同符号）での簡易的な最大リプル電流の推定（比例関係モデル）\n# ripple_coefficient_powering: 力行側リプル係数 (A / (N・m * rpm))\n# torque: モータートルク (N・m)\n# speed: モーター回転数 (rpm)\n\nabs_torque = abs(motor_torque)\nabs_speed = abs(motor_speed)\n\nif (motor_torque >= 0 and motor_speed >= 0) or (motor_torque <= 0 and motor_speed <= 0):\n    # 力行動作領域\n    max_ripple_powering = abs_torque * abs_speed * ripple_coefficient_powering\nelse:\n    # 回生動作領域では力行側リプルは最小の基礎リプルのみ\n    max_ripple_powering = 0.1", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T13:03:09.534441", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
