{"id": "0ef1886d-6bdb-4e09-b999-ce083d81e233", "name": "回生最大リプル電流計算制約", "description": "モーターの回転数とトルクから回生動作領域における最大リプル電流を簡易計算します。", "inputNames": ["motor_torque", "motor_speed", "ripple_coefficient_regenerative"], "outputNames": ["max_ripple_regenerative"], "parameters": {}, "code": "# 回生側（トルクと回転数が異符号）での簡易的な最大リプル電流の推定（比例関係モデル）\n# ripple_coefficient_regenerative: 回生側リプル係数 (A / (N・m * rpm))\n# torque: モータートルク (N・m)\n# speed: モーター回転数 (rpm)\n\nabs_torque = abs(motor_torque)\nabs_speed = abs(motor_speed)\n\nif (motor_torque > 0 and motor_speed < 0) or (motor_torque < 0 and motor_speed > 0):\n    # 回生動作領域\n    max_ripple_regenerative = abs_torque * abs_speed * ripple_coefficient_regenerative\nelse:\n    # 力行動作領域では回生側リプルは最小の基礎リプルのみ\n    max_ripple_regenerative = 0.1", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T13:03:09.542302", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
