{"id": "f2c0b90b-e1e1-423f-8bf4-e5def93fd182", "name": "セル電圧超過量および安全マージン算出制約", "description": "現在のセル電圧と各種限界電圧（劣化限界、発煙限界申請値、発煙発火限界実値）を比較し、それぞれの超過電圧量と、申請値と実値の間の安全マージンを算出します。", "inputNames": ["current_cell_voltage", "degradation_voltage_limit", "smoke_voltage_limit_nominal", "smoke_voltage_limit_actual"], "outputNames": ["voltage_excess_degradation", "voltage_excess_nominal", "voltage_excess_actual", "safety_margin_smoke"], "parameters": {}, "code": "# セル電圧が各閾値を超えている場合の、劣化および発煙・発火リスクの危険度合い（電圧超過量）を算出する。\n# 安全マージン（発煙限界電圧実値 - 発煙限界電圧申請値）も合わせて算出する。\n\nvoltage_excess_degradation = max(0.0, current_cell_voltage - degradation_voltage_limit)\nvoltage_excess_nominal = max(0.0, current_cell_voltage - smoke_voltage_limit_nominal)\nvoltage_excess_actual = max(0.0, current_cell_voltage - smoke_voltage_limit_actual)\nsafety_margin_smoke = smoke_voltage_limit_actual - smoke_voltage_limit_nominal", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T13:03:11.385363", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
